{"id": "EUVD-2026-104578", "enisaUuid": "02a0712f-4cb2-311b-b383-ce57c0bfffde", "description": "Craft CMS from 5.0.0 before 5.11.0 contains a remote code execution vulnerability that allows authenticated Control Panel users to escape the Twig sandbox via Asset::getMimeType transforms. Attackers can supply 'as' or 'on' keys passed unfiltered to Craft::createObject, attaching malicious behaviors or event handlers that execute code as the web user.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T19:10:51", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T16:10:01", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/craftcms/cms/security/advisories/GHSA-qm9x-rmcj-h2rc", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/craft-cms-5.0.0-before-5.11.0-rce-via-asset-getmimetype-transform-injection"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112772", "GHSA-rvqf-xwq6-2q7c"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.58, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "efa3a38b-cb39-3c41-a4f2-c2409497c6d1", "product": {"name": "CMS", "vendor": {"name": "statamic"}}, "product_version": "5.0.0 <5.11.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d7ab3df1-d68e-3219-971a-7a9338466917", "vendor": {"name": "craftcms"}}], "isExploited": false}